    "finding": "The declared p95 limit is 3.3 microseconds above a 60 FPS cap period. The limit is therefore attainable in principle, but only if 95 percent of frames land within 3.3 microseconds of the cap period. Measured pacing jitter was about 221 microseconds, roughly 66 times the permitted budget, so the run fails.",
